      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think something is wrong with my reality. i was at the grocery store today and saw the exact same guy walk past me twice, like, literally in the same clothes and everything but he was walking in the opposite direction. then a few mins later i heard a stranger say the exact same weird phrase \"the clock is ticking\" right after the cashier said it. it felt like a loop or a bug. do u ever feel like things around u are just... repeating or glitching out? like the world isnt as solid as it looks?",
